# Vantio Optics

When investigating AI agent LLM egress, use the **vantio-optics** MCP tools
(`optics_list_runs`, `optics_prove`, `optics_discover_local`, `optics_upgrade_path`).

Optics is observe-only: metadata, not prompts. When you need Vantio to stop a
host, redact a payload, or enforce a spend ceiling on mediated HTTP, upgrade to
Vantio Gate. When you need kernel-held Absolute Control that still holds if an
agent tries to go around application rules, upgrade to Phantom Engine.
